   "html": "<section class=\"block card onchain-card\"><h2>On-chain <span class=\"tag\">CheckOnChain</span><span class=\"tag soft\">as of Nov 1</span></h2><p class=\"sec-story\">Short-term valuation +0.04 Fair, long-term −0.32 Undervalued, price 3% above <abbr class=\"gl\" title=\"Short-term holders: coins held under ~155 days.\" tabindex=\"0\">STH</abbr> cost basis.</p><div class=\"oc-hero\"><div class=\"oc-cycle\"><div class=\"label\">Short-term valuation · Nov 1</div><div class=\"value\">+0.04</div><span class=\"sig neutral\">⚪ Fair</span><p class=\"table-note\">30d −0.65 · each metric ranked vs its own 2y history; −1 deep value · 0 fair · +1 overheated</p><table class=\"data\"><thead><tr><th>Component</th><th class=\"num\">Value</th><th class=\"num\">Score</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>STH-<abbr class=\"gl\" title=\"Market value vs. realized value: price compared with the average cost basis of all coins. Above 1 = holders in profit on average.\" tabindex=\"0\">MVRV</abbr></td><td class=\"num\">1.02</td><td class=\"num\"><span class=\"sig neutral\">+0.10</span></td></tr><tr><td>STH-<abbr class=\"gl\" title=\"Spent output profit ratio: are coins being sold at a profit (&gt;1) or loss (&lt;1)?\" tabindex=\"0\">SOPR</abbr> (7d avg)</td><td class=\"num\">1.002</td><td class=\"num\"><span class=\"sig neutral\">+0.10</span></td></tr><tr><td>STH-<abbr class=\"gl\" title=\"Net unrealized profit/loss: share of market value that is paper profit. Higher = more euphoria.\" tabindex=\"0\">NUPL</abbr></td><td class=\"num\">0.024</td><td class=\"num\"><span class=\"sig neutral\">+0.10</span></td></tr><tr><td>Mayer Multiple</td><td class=\"num\">1.06</td><td class=\"num\"><span class=\"sig neutral\">+0.04</span></td></tr><tr><td>STH supply in profit</td><td class=\"num\">41.3%</td><td class=\"num\"><span class=\"sig neutral\">−0.14</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"oc-breadth\"><div class=\"label\">Long-term valuation · Nov 1</div><div class=\"value\">−0.32</d