e\">ETH</td><td class=\"num\">$2,306.93</td><td class=\"num neg\" title=\"7d\">-0.58%</td><td class=\"num neg\">-14.16%</td><td><span class=\"sig neutral sm\">⚪ Range-bound</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"dim-name\"><abbr class=\"gl\" title=\"US dollar index.\" tabindex=\"0\">DXY</abbr></td><td class=\"num\">101.91</td><td class=\"num neg\" title=\"5 sessions\">-0.28%</td><td class=\"num neg\">-0.02%</td><td><span class=\"sig watch sm\">🟡 Flat</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"dim-name\">U.S. 10Y</td><td class=\"num\">4.93%</td><td class=\"num neg\" title=\"5 sessions\">-6 bp</td><td class=\"num neg\">-36 bp</td><td><span class=\"sig pos sm\">🟢 Yields falling</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"dim-name\">S&amp;P 500</td><td class=\"num\">7,580</td><td class=\"num neg\" title=\"5 sessions\">-0.57%</td><td class=\"num neg\">-0.93%</td><td><span class=\"sig neutral sm\">⚪ Range-bound</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"dim-name\">Nasdaq</td><td class=\"num\">25,437</td><td class=\"num neg\" title=\"5 sessions\">-2.00%</td><td class=\"num neg\">-5.30%</td><td><span class=\"sig neutral sm\">⚪ Range-bound</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"dim-name\">VIX</td><td class=\"num\">19.4</td><td class=\"num neg\" title=\"5 sessions\">-0.15%</td><td class=\"num pos\">+18.85%</td><td><span class=\"sig watch sm\">🟡 Alert</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"table-note\">WoW = 7 days (crypto) / 5 sessions (markets) · MoM = 1 month.</p></section>"
