   "html": "<section class=\"block card xpulse-card\"><h2>X analyst pulse <span class=\"tag\">X · Nov 2</span></h2><div class=\"xp-verdict warn\"><div class=\"xp-verdict-main\"><span class=\"xp-verdict-lbl\">Crowd read</span><span class=\"xp-verdict-txt\">Analysts lean <strong>cautious</strong></span></div><div class=\"xp-verdict-meta\"><span class=\"xp-count pos\">2 bullish</span><span class=\"xp-count warn\">3 neutral</span><span class=\"xp-count neg\">1 bearish</span><span class=\"src-chip agree\">Agrees with our Cautious regime</span></div></div><ul class=\"xp-list\"><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2116875476731875655\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @Darkfost_Coc\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2116875476731875655.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig warn\">Neutral</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">flows</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">After Binance reopened withdrawals, 19 569 BTC, 154 147 ETH, $1.96 billion in USDT and $557 million in USDC left the exchange.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2116875476731875655\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@Darkfost_Coc</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Nov 1</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2116875476731875655\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2116817592740417755\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @AxelAdlerJr\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2116817592740417755.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig warn\">Neutral</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">on-chain</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">Bitcoin is still above the short-term holder cost basis, but the cushion has narrowed to 2.3%.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2116817592740417755\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@AxelAdlerJr</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Nov 1</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2116817592740417755\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2116489229865717801\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @Darkfost_Coc\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2116489229865717801.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig warn\">Neutral</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">on-chain</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">STH-<abbr class=\"gl\" title=\"Market value vs. realized value: price compared with the average cost basis of all coins. Above 1 = holders in profit on average.\" tabindex=\"0\">MVRV</abbr> is back near the neutral 1 level after topping above 1.18 in late September.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2116489229865717801\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@Darkfost_Coc</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 31</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2116489229865717801\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/ki_young_ju/status/2116093579256791231\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @ki_young_ju\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2116093579256791231.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig pos\">Bullish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">flows</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">The Coinbase Premium hit a 4-year low, last seen in Nov 2022 right after FTX.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/ki_young_ju/status/2116093579256791231\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@ki_young_ju</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 30</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/ki_young_ju/status/2116093579256791231\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/ecoinometrics/status/2116913931969257496\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @ecoinometrics\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2116913931969257496.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig neg\">Bearish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">macro</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">The Fed held, but its press-conference tone scored more hawkish again in October, so the pause is not read as the end of tightening.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/ecoinometrics/status/2116913931969257496\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@ecoinometrics</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Nov 1</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/ecoinometrics/status/2116913931969257496\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/jvisserlabs/status/2116885468830892282\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @jvisserlabs\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2116885468830892282.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig pos\">Bullish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">macro</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">S&amp;P 500 breadth went from 20% of stocks above the 50-day average to 60% in October.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/jvisserlabs/status/2116885468830892282\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@jvisserlabs</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Nov 1</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/jvisserlabs/status/2116885468830892282\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li></ul><p class=\"xp-note\">Curated data-first analysts only · paraphrased, not advice</p></section>"
